Section B question one: online shop orders and warehouse despatch.

2
00:00:04,814 --> 00:00:07,366
Part (a), three marks, three slots.

3
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:13,347
Task: classify four items as hardware, software, data or procedure, with a reason.

4
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:17,285
Thermal despatch printer: hardware, a physical device.

5
00:00:17,285 --> 00:00:21,223
Stock-management app: software, an executable program.

6
00:00:21,223 --> 00:00:24,359
Customer order records: data, stored facts.

7
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:28,954
Staff guide for checking goods: procedure, steps people follow.

8
00:00:28,954 --> 00:00:32,601
Any three correct classifications earn full marks.

9
00:00:32,601 --> 00:00:37,560
Do not call order records software, or call the printer output data.

